zed":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669915542","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103019#issuecomment-2669915542","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103019","id":2669915542,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fI62W","user":{"login":"anarelion","id":2111343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTEzNDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2111343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion","html_url":"https://github.com/anarelion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T22:35:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T23:08:05Z","body":"Built godot on revision `93d270693079ea7802c9e1334a2e0ecd8529eeed` (same as 4.4beta4 if I am not mistaken) with:\n- `scons platform=windows vsproj=yes dev_build=yes debug_symbols=yes module_mono_enabled=yes`\n- Build with Visual Studio 17.12.3\n- ` .\\bin\\godot.windows.editor.dev.x86_64.mono.console.exe --headless --generate-mono-glue modules/mono/glue`\n- `<path>\\python.exe ./modules/mono/build_scripts/build_assemblies.py --godot-output-dir=./bin`\n- Run without debugger (options seem editor/x64/blank)\n\nNo errors at all, nothing, all files can be opened and all works fine.\n\nTried deleting most of the files in the .godot folder and opened again, all working fine.\n\nTried removing the `dev_build=yes` from scons and then rebuilt everything and doesn't reproduce.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669915542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2671186663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103019#issuecomment-2671186663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103019","id":2671186663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fNxLn","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T11:11:29Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T11:11:29Z","body":"The official build are compiled using GCC and `lto=full production=yes` so can be a GCC exclusive bug or related to one of these parameters, so you can try in this order:\n\n- Compile as you did but adding `production=yes` (faster)\n- Set MinGW (GCC) and compile with `vsproj=yes module_mono_enabled=yes debug_symbols=yes produciton=yes use_mingw=yes lto=none` (a bit more slow)\n- Set MinGW (GCC) and compile with `vsproj=yes module_mono_enabled=yes debug_symbols=yes produciton=yes use_mingw=yes lto=full` (last option because is slower and require a good amount of RAM to do)\n\n<br>\n\nAnother process that can help is find which version the crash started, so we can check what changed and look for a possible culprit.\n\n\n\n ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2671186663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672621357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103019#issuecomment-2672621357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103019","id":2672621357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fTPct","user":{"login":"anarelion","id":2111343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTEzNDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2111343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion","html_url":"https://github.com/anarelion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anarelion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T20:34:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T03:09:15Z","body":"Please consider I am not deleting any files between tests.\n\nSo Visual Studio with `production=yes lto=full` works, and going back to official build still fails.\n\n`scons platform=windows debug_symbols=yes module_mono_enabled=yes production=yes lto=none use_mingw=yes` works fine without any error.\n\nInstalled MinGW with `scoop install gcc python scons make mingw`\n\nRun `scons platform=windows debug_symbols=yes module_mono_enabled=yes production=yes lto=full use_mingw=yes` and it does the full build loop.\n\nRun `.\\bin\\godot.windows.editor.x86_64.mono.console.exe` and load my project, and all is great.\n\nAfter that, I opened v4.4beta4 and loaded my project and it crashed. At no point I did click on anything that saves\n\n\n\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672621357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674645651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103019#issuecomment-2674645651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103019","id":2674645651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fa9qT","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht